.TH g.download.project 1 "" "GRASS 8.4.1" "GRASS GIS User's Manual"
.SH NAME
\fI\fBg.download.project.py\fR\fR  \- Download GRASS project from the web
.br
Get GRASS project from an URL or file path
.SH KEYWORDS
general, data, download, import
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBg.download.project.py\fR
.br
\fBg.download.project.py \-\-help\fR
.br
\fBg.download.project.py\fR \fBurl\fR=\fIstring\fR  [\fBname\fR=\fIname\fR]   [\fBpath\fR=\fIpath\fR]   [\-\-\fBhelp\fR]  [\-\-\fBverbose\fR]  [\-\-\fBquiet\fR]  [\-\-\fBui\fR]
.SS Flags:
.IP "\fB\-\-help\fR" 4m
.br
Print usage summary
.IP "\fB\-\-verbose\fR" 4m
.br
Verbose module output
.IP "\fB\-\-quiet\fR" 4m
.br
Quiet module output
.IP "\fB\-\-ui\fR" 4m
.br
Force launching GUI dialog
.SS Parameters:
.IP "\fBurl\fR=\fIstring\fR \fB[required]\fR" 4m
.br
URL of the archive with a project to be downloaded
.br
URL of ZIP, TAR.GZ, or other similar archive
.IP "\fBname\fR=\fIname\fR" 4m
.br
Project (location) name
.br
Project name (not path to project)
.IP "\fBpath\fR=\fIpath\fR" 4m
.br
GRASS GIS database directory
.br
Default: path to the current GRASS GIS database
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fIg.download.project\fR downloads an archived (e.g.,
\fC.zip\fR or \fC.tar.gz\fR) project (previously called
location) from a given URL
and unpacks it to a specified or current GRASS GIS Spatial Database.
URL can be also a local file on the disk.
If the archive contains a directory which contains a project, the module
will recognize that and use the project automatically.
The first directory which is a project is used.
Other projects or any other files are ignored.
.SH EXAMPLES
.SS Download the full GRASS GIS sample project within a running session
Download and unpack the full North Carolina sample project into the user\(cqs
HOME directory:
.br
.nf
\fC
g.download.project url=https://grass.osgeo.org/sampledata/north_carolina/nc_spm_full_v2alpha2.tar.gz path=$HOME
\fR
.fi
.SS Download the full GRASS GIS sample project in a temporary session
In a temporary session, download and unpack the full North Carolina sample project
into the user\(cqs HOME directory:
.br
.nf
\fC
grass \-\-tmp\-project XY \-\-exec g.download.project url=https://grass.osgeo.org/sampledata/north_carolina/nc_spm_full_v2alpha2.tar.gz path=$HOME
\fR
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fI
g.mapset,
g.mapsets,
r.proj,
v.proj,
g.proj.all
\fR
